    },
    {
      "key": "95f7c1f0",
      "text": "A fork makes two ways to win on the next turn. Look for a square that starts both paths.",
      "path": "/audio/en/95f7c1f0-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "47b90a1f",
      "text": "A new fern frond often uncurls from a tight spiral.",
      "path": "/audio/en/47b90a1f-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "906930fb",
      "text": "A river is flowing water that can wear a path through the land.",
      "path": "/audio/en/906930fb-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "97e2883c",
      "text": "A row needs three marks. You can reset and try another plan.",
      "path": "/audio/en/97e2883c-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "f6991245",
      "text": "A wetland is a place where the ground stays very wet. Some wetlands dry out for part of the year.",
      "path": "/audio/en/f6991245-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "9db34942",
      "text": "Allosaurus was a meat-eating dinosaur with small horns above its eyes.",
      "path": "/audio/en/9db34942-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "717508c6",
      "text": "Ankylosaurus had bony armor and a heavy club at the end of its tail.",
      "path": "/audio/en/717508c6-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "824c8162",
      "text": "Brachiosaurus had front legs longer than its back legs.",
      "path": "/audio/en/824c8162-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "36ed1e9b",
      "text": "Brilliant counting!",
      "path": "/audio/en/36ed1e9b-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "d19ae22c",
      "text": "Carnotaurus had two horns on top of its head and very small arms.",
      "path": "/audio/en/d19ae22c-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "b9a50200",
      "text": "Check your count badges once more.",
      "path": "/audio/en/b9a50200-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "3b259f66",
      "text": "Choose Next when you are ready.",
      "path": "/audio/en/3b259f66-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "932d4aa9",
      "text": "Corythosaurus was a duck-billed dinosaur with a helmet-shaped head crest.",
      "path": "/audio/en/932d4aa9-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "86be0e32",
      "text": "Count one visible group, then the other group. Add the two totals.",
      "path": "/audio/en/86be0e32-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "e1316120",
      "text": "Deserts get very little rain. Some deserts are cold, not hot.",
      "path": "/audio/en/e1316120-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "f5db223c",
      "text": "Dilophosaurus had two bony crests on its head.",
      "path": "/audio/en/f5db223c-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "f2052218",
      "text": "Dino made a line of three!",
      "path": "/audio/en/f2052218-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "bce81c3e",
      "text": "Ferns make spores instead of flowers or seeds.",
      "path": "/audio/en/bce81c3e-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "d579cda9",
      "text": "Find the featured creature. Open a numbered cover to look underneath.",
      "path": "/audio/en/d579cda9-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "7b4cce67",
      "text": "Follow the dotted path in order. Start at the green number and move toward the arrow.",
      "path": "/audio/en/7b4cce67-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "97d93db8",
      "text": "Follow the footprints near the rocky ledge.",
      "path": "/audio/en/97d93db8-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "4342cb3d",
      "text": "Follow the glimmer beside the cave wall.",
      "path": "/audio/en/4342cb3d-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "1771fc02",
      "text": "Follow the warm, winding clue near the rocky ground.",
      "path": "/audio/en/1771fc02-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "e056035a",
      "text": "Fossil footprints are clues that show where an animal walked.",
      "path": "/audio/en/e056035a-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "f4fb7fb1",
      "text": "Great counting!",
      "path": "/audio/en/f4fb7fb1-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "948674f9",
      "text": "How many did you count?",
      "path": "/audio/en/948674f9-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "aaa902d7",
      "text": "Look along the bright colours in the sky.",
      "path": "/audio/en/aaa902d7-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "c16f2e8a",
      "text": "Look close to the ancient shoreline.",
      "path": "/audio/en/c16f2e8a-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "eba32a38",
      "text": "Look for the creature hiding in this leafy place.",
      "path": "/audio/en/eba32a38-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "2bed27f3",
      "text": "Look in the lower left spot.",
      "path": "/audio/en/2bed27f3-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "027dc5a4",
      "text": "Look in the lower right spot.",
      "path": "/audio/en/027dc5a4-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "bab15fa8",
      "text": "Look in the upper left spot.",
      "path": "/audio/en/bab15fa8-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "ec74c2e4",
      "text": "Look in the upper middle spot.",
      "path": "/audio/en/ec74c2e4-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "1f1c2db1",
      "text": "Look in the upper right spot.",
      "path": "/audio/en/1f1c2db1-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "0410561f",
      "text": "Look near the shallow water and reeds.",
      "path": "/audio/en/0410561f-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "b5cddefb",
      "text": "Look near the shapes made by wind and sand.",
      "path": "/audio/en/b5cddefb-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "08870865",
      "text": "Look where the water path bends through the scene.",
      "path": "/audio/en/08870865-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "421e8dd5",
      "text": "Moonlight is sunlight reflected from the Moon.",
      "path": "/audio/en/421e8dd5-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "6f1a93e8",
      "text": "Not that square yet. Look for the glowing lesson clue or reset and try again.",
      "path": "/audio/en/6f1a93e8-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "ba16bc69",
      "text": "Not this cover. Try another spot, or choose Show a clue.",
      "path": "/audio/en/ba16bc69-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "1d34ca61",
      "text": "Parasaurolophus had a long hollow head crest. It may have helped make sounds.",
      "path": "/audio/en/1d34ca61-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "f4def1e8",
      "text": "Place one mark that makes two winning paths for your next turn.",
      "path": "/audio/en/f4def1e8-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "8e51ffee",
      "text": "Plesiosaurs were marine reptiles, not dinosaurs.",
      "path": "/audio/en/8e51ffee-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "03a953b6",
      "text": "Point to each shape once. The numbered badges keep your place.",
      "path": "/audio/en/03a953b6-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "d669520c",
      "text": "Raindrops bend and reflect sunlight, spreading it into rainbow colours.",
      "path": "/audio/en/d669520c-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "233e5c93",
      "text": "Read one row at a time, and use each badge to keep your place.",
      "path": "/audio/en/233e5c93-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "282007e2",
      "text": "Rock beneath Earth’s surface is called magma. Once it erupts, it is called lava.",
      "path": "/audio/en/282007e2-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "dcf926f3",
      "text": "Rocket has two in a row. Put your mark in the last square to block the line.",
      "path": "/audio/en/dcf926f3-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "db56eb63",
      "text": "Rocket is nearly at three. Put a Dino mark in the square that stops the line.",
      "path": "/audio/en/db56eb63-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "584ae166",
      "text": "Rocket made a line of three. Try a new plan.",
      "path": "/audio/en/584ae166-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "7767a176",
      "text": "Search around the snowy tracks.",
      "path": "/audio/en/7767a176-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "466f3a25",
      "text": "Search between the tall fern fronds.",
      "path": "/audio/en/466f3a25-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "29407cc8",
      "text": "Search under the quiet night sky.",
      "path": "/audio/en/29407cc8-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "7e216f14",
      "text": "Show me a stroke.",
      "path": "/audio/en/7e216f14-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "519ce93e",
      "text": "Snowflakes are groups of ice crystals that grow inside cold clouds.",
      "path": "/audio/en/519ce93e-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "68d5f96d",
      "text": "Spinosaurus had a tall sail on its back. Scientists still study what it was for.",
      "path": "/audio/en/68d5f96d-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "2c9108b1",
      "text": "Stegosaurus had bony plates along its back. Their exact purpose is still being studied.",
      "path": "/audio/en/2c9108b1-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "9385938b",
      "text": "T. rex had short arms and powerful jaws.",
      "path": "/audio/en/9385938b-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "bbfbcf12",
      "text": "Take your time. Lift your finger before you start the next stroke.",
      "path": "/audio/en/bbfbcf12-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "93fa9195",
      "text": "Tap each object once to count it.",
      "path": "/audio/en/93fa9195-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "9fd58454",
      "text": "That is the right total. Each object was counted once.",
      "path": "/audio/en/9fd58454-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "6d8b847b",
      "text": "That is the word. You traced the letter and matched its first sound.",
      "path": "/audio/en/6d8b847b-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "7f63350c",
      "text": "That mark opens two different winning squares for your next turn.",
      "path": "/audio/en/7f63350c-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "f301a963",
      "text": "That move shows the tactic. Look at the line or paths you made.",
      "path": "/audio/en/f301a963-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "e9c36eda",
      "text": "The board is full. That is a draw. Try a new board.",
      "path": "/audio/en/e9c36eda-matilda.mp3",
      "ready": true
    },
    {
      "key": "7d57ac21",
      "text": "The word starts with this letter sound.",
